<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Advtech cautions still in talks.</title>
<headline>Advtech cautions still in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African education and training firm Advanced Technical Systems Ltd (Advtech) said on Friday that it was still in talks that, if successful, could have an effect on its share price.</p>
<p>&quot;Accordingly, shareholders should exercise caution in dealing in their shares in Advtech,&quot; the firm said.</p>
<p>Advtech first issued a cautionary statement on May 7 at the same time as it bought Crawford Education Group from Graeme Crawford and LeisureNet Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
